.TH PROCEDURAL-VISUALIZER-TOOL 1 "September 2026" "Procedural Visualizer Tool 17.11.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
procedural-visualizer-tool \- create seamless looping procedural animations
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B procedural-visualizer-tool
.RI [ --language " locale|system" ]
.RI [ project.pvt ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B procedural-visualizer-tool
is a Qt desktop editor for layered procedural artwork, reusable motion paths,
music-responsive timing, project history, and PNG or OpenEXR frame export.
.PP
If a project path is supplied, the application opens it after creating the
main window.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI --language " locale|system"
Override the interface language for this launch without changing the saved
preference. Use a Qt locale such as de, pt-BR, or fa, or system to follow the
operating system's preferred languages. Unavailable translations fall back to
English. A persistent choice is available in Application Settings and takes
effect after restarting the application.
.TP
.B --localization-info
Print the selected language, available embedded catalogs, toolkit translation
status, and layout direction as JSON, then exit. Return a failure status if
required embedded translation resources are missing.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B *.pvt
Legacy text project files. Versioned ZIP project bundles can also be opened
from the application's project controls.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pvt-render (1)
.SH AUTHOR
GNA Services Inc.
